sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant C as Client
    participant API as FastAPI Router
    participant GTM as GameTurnManager
    participant SM as Mechanics LLM (Small)
    participant VAL as Pass 1.5 Validator & DB
    participant CM as Narration LLM (Complex)
    participant ME as Media Engine
    participant TTS as TTS Engine

    C->>API: POST /adventures/{game_id}/chat (content, auto_visualize, language)
    API->>GTM: process_turn()
    GTM-->>C: SSE event: status ("Validating rules...")

    rect rgb(240, 248, 255)
        note over GTM,SM: Pass 1: Mechanics Evaluation
        GTM->>SM: Prompt (Character Sheet, Location Context, Exits, Quests, Awards)
        SM-->>GTM: GameEvent (Requested scene change, entity updates, exit states, switch/container actions)
    end

    rect rgb(255, 245, 238)
        note over GTM,VAL: Pass 1.5: Rule Validation & Reversion
        GTM->>VAL: Validate state updates against DB gates (required items, codes, flags)
        alt Illegal action / Missing key item or code
            VAL-->>GTM: Revert state update & append to rule_violations list
        else Valid action
            VAL-->>GTM: Accept state update
        end
    end

    GTM-->>C: SSE event: state (Pre-narration UI state)
    GTM-->>C: SSE event: status ("Generating narrative...")

    rect rgb(245, 255, 245)
        note over GTM,CM: Pass 2: Atmospheric Narration
        alt Has rule_violations
            GTM->>CM: Narrative prompt overridden with rule_violations failure instructions
        else Normal Turn
            GTM->>CM: Narrative prompt with validated GameEvent outcome
        end
        CM-->>GTM: Streamed narrative prose
        GTM-->>C: SSE event: message (Narration text chunk)
    end

    rect rgb(250, 250, 250)
        note over GTM,VAL: State Persistence & Map Tracking
        GTM->>VAL: Persist Avatar Stats, Inventories, Scene, and WorldMap discovery
        opt Auto-Visualize (if scene change or image requested)
            GTM->>ME: Generate Scene/Entity visual
            ME-->>GTM: local_path & /data/... URL
            GTM->>VAL: Update WorldScene / WorldEntity image
        end
    end

    opt TTS Spoken Narration
        C->>API: POST /api/tts/generate (narration text)
        API->>TTS: Synthesize Speech (Strip vocal tags [whispers], resolve voice)
        TTS-->>API: Audio Stream / URL
        API-->>C: Audio playback
    end
